                    <ref target="#d426">Document 426</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d428-f3" n="3" xml:id="d428-f3-content">
                <p>For text of Goldberg’s speech before the International Platform Association at
                    Washington, D.C., on July 27, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, August 28, 1967, pp. 262–265.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
